      "end_seconds": 8.46,
      "duration_seconds": 7.74,
      "text": "Okay, so hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.74,
      "end_seconds": 13.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.92,
      "end_seconds": 32.43,
      "duration_seconds": 17.51,
      "text": "Ah, I wanted to get heavy bleeding after the birth looked at. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.7,
      "end_seconds": 37.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.35,
      "end_seconds": 51.0,
      "duration_seconds": 12.65,
      "text": "probably two weeks yeah hmm, I've had a racing heart too, for three days hmm, and I've been feeling faint as well"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.68,
      "end_seconds": 57.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "So, is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.87,
      "end_seconds": 63.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "Maybe a six out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.02,
      "end_seconds": 67.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "let's start with the basic checks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.94,
      "end_seconds": 77.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Right, that's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.24,
      "end_seconds": 97.44,
      "duration_seconds": 7.2,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 97 over 65, respiratory rate 18, heart rate 107. And temperature 36.9."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.84,
      "end_seconds": 115.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "And what about severe pain, fever or headache?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.2,
      "end_seconds": 124.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "no, nothing to report there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.98,
      "end_seconds": 129.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.29,
      "end_seconds": 133.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "nothing else aches"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.79,
      "end_seconds": 136.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.92,
      "end_seconds": 144.51,
      "duration_seconds": 7.59,
      "text": "Yes, I had my appendix taken out, when I was in my twenties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.56,
      "end_seconds": 151.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.9,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.44,
      "end_seconds": 164.38,
      "duration_seconds": 10.94,
      "text": "Sorry, um, what was I saying, I've had migraines, yes. My neighbour said I should get it looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.2,
      "end_seconds": 174.92,
      "duration_seconds": 8.72,
      "text": "Alright, migraines, that matches what I have here. Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.62,
      "end_seconds": 180.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, when needed for my migraines"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.32,
      "end_seconds": 187.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.59,
      "end_seconds": 200.3,
      "duration_seconds": 11.71,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day. I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.0,
      "end_seconds": 203.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Right, have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.2,
      "end_seconds": 208.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Yes, wheat. I get itchy skin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.16,
      "end_seconds": 228.07,
      "duration_seconds": 7.91,
      "text": "okay, so my impression from what you've said is this: It fits best with a postpartum haemorrhage"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.82,
      "end_seconds": 231.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.28,
      "end_seconds": 253.72,
      "duration_seconds": 20.44,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a postpartum haemorrhage, and we'll know more once the an urgent scan is back. Let's get an urgent scan, for bleeding. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.35,
      "end_seconds": 257.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "That's fine with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.79,
      "end_seconds": 270.43,
      "duration_seconds": 11.64,
      "text": "We should do urgent blood tests for haemorrhage. The treatment will be oxytocin, 10 units, now, single dose. That should help with postpartum bleeding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.38,
      "end_seconds": 275.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "okay, so fine, I'll begin it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.68,
      "end_seconds": 288.28,
      "duration_seconds": 10.6,
      "text": "I am rubbing the womb to help it contract, and calling the emergency team. I'm gonna send a referral to the obstetric team."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.51,
      "end_seconds": 292.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.15,
      "end_seconds": 308.96,
      "duration_seconds": 14.81,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. I'd like to see you again straight away. Alright, anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.75,
      "end_seconds": 313.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks"
    }
  ]
